I) print-ready graphics featuring completely transparent backgrounds.\n\n📐 Technical Specifications & Use:\nFile Format: Transparent PNG.\n\nResolution: 300 DPI high-quality print files.\n\nCompatibility: Fully compatible with Canva, Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator, Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Studio, and all major graphic design software.\n\nNote: This is a premium digital clipart download collection. No physical goods will be shipped to your address.",
